   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order may be cited as the Broadcasting (Exemption) Order 2008 and shall come into operation on 10th March 2008."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H337-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Exemption"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2.—(1) The Minister hereby exempts from Part X of the Act any broadcasting company which holds a Niche Subscription TV Licence granted by the Authority under section 8 of the Act.\n(2) The Minister may, at any time, revoke the exemption of any broadcasting company under sub-paragraph (1) by written notice to the broadcasting company."
   }
